    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTeam Myles O'Donoghue are delighted to bring to 51 Whitestown Park to the market. This superb three bedroom semi-detached family home, ideally positioned within the popular residential development of Whitestown Park, Dublin 15.\n\nPresented in good condition throughout, this bright and well-proportioned home comprises; entrance hall, spacious living room to the front and a modern kitchen to the rear. The ground floor benefits from tiled flooring throughout, providing a practical and contemporary finish.\n\nUpstairs there are three bedrooms, comprising two generous double bedrooms and a single bedroom, together with a fully tiled family bathroom. The stairs and landing have recently been fitted with brand new carpets, adding a fresh and modern feel to the upper accommodation. The property also benefits from solar panels, offering an excellent energy-efficient feature for the new owners.\n\nWhitestown Park enjoys a convenient location within Dublin 15, with a wide range of local amenities, shops, cafs and services close by. The area is well served by a selection of schools, parks and recreational facilities, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and its extensive range of retail, leisure and dining amenities are within easy reach.\n\nThe property also benefits from excellent transport links, with Dublin Bus services providing regular access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The N3 and M50 motorway networks are also easily accessible, providing convenient connectivity for commuters travelling throughout Dublin and beyond.\n\nFeatures\nGas fired central heating\nOff street parking\nSolar panels\nStone tiling on ground floor throughout\nNew carpets on stairs and landing\nJacuzzi feature bath\nBER D BER No: 119813855\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall: 3.77m x 1.809m with tiled flooring and understairs storage space.\n\nLiving Room: 4.26m x 3.24m spacious living room with tiled flooring and bay window providing excellent natural light overlooking the front garden with feature coal effect fireplace.\n\nKitchen: 5.17m x 3.15m well-proportioned area, kitchen with a range of fitted units incorporating work top areas with tiled surround and tiled floor.\n\nStaircase to first floor.\n\nBedroom 1: 4.22m x 2.78m large double bedroom positioned to the front of the house with timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 2: 2.90m x 2.34m large double bedroom positioned to the rear of the house with timber flooring and a number of fitted slide wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3: 2.80m x 2.53m positioned to the front of the house with timber flooring and built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom: 2.09m x 1.77m White suite incorporating jacuzzi feature bath with WHB in vanity unit and WC. Fully Tiled.\n\nPlease be advised Myles O'Donoghue Properties have not tested any appliances, apparatus, fixtures or fittings. No warranty or guarantee is given on the above, interested parties must undertake their own investigation regarding the working order of any appliances, apparatus, fixtures or fittings.\nInformation and particulars detailed on this brochure are issued by Team Myles O'Donoghue Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of the information and particulars they do not constitute an invitation to treat, an offer or a contract of any nature whether express or implied. All descriptions dimensions, maps, plans, artist impressions, references regarding condition, permissions, licences of use or occupation, access and any details are for guidance only and may be subject to change, without prior notification. The information and particulars are provided in good faith but no intending purchaser or tenant should rely on them as statements or representations of fact and are specifically advised to undertake its own due diligence at its own expense to satisfy itself as to the accuracy and correctness of the information and particulars given. No employees of Team Myles O' Donoghue Properties agents or affiliate companies make any warranty or representations whether express or implied with respect to the information and particulars and which are to the fullest extent permitted by law, disclaimed; furthermore, such parties accept no liability in respect of any loss suffered by any intending purchaser or tenant or any third party arising out of the information and particulars. Prices are quoted exclusive of applicable taxes such as VAT Stamp Duty (unless otherwise stated) and all negotiations are conducted on the basis that the purchaser / tenant shall be liable of any VAT Stamp Duty arising from the transaction.\n\n"
      },
